00:13:17.683 --> 00:13:18.607
- Well, that's the whole ...

00:13:18.607 --> 00:13:20.829
The whole game's broken, because everybody

00:13:20.829 --> 00:13:24.235
is too tied up into
other people's opinions.

00:13:24.235 --> 00:13:27.015
I only care about my opinion of myself.

00:13:27.015 --> 00:13:29.149
And I care what my mom and wife and kids

00:13:29.149 --> 00:13:32.813
and the world think, just
not as much as I care

00:13:32.813 --> 00:13:35.435
about the way I think about myself.

00:13:35.435 --> 00:13:38.722
And that's it, just that slight advantage.

00:13:38.722 --> 00:13:41.858
And I think most of you care more about

00:13:41.858 --> 00:13:43.770
what other people think than
what you think about yourself

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.779
and/or you actually don't feel
good about yourself, right?

00:13:46.779 --> 00:13:48.826
The thing that made me smile,

00:13:48.826 --> 00:13:50.756
