00:14:05.851 --> 00:14:08.494
tens of thousands
thinking I'm the coolest.

00:14:08.494 --> 00:14:11.244
And that's it. I mean, that's it.

00:14:12.568 --> 00:14:15.179
And that's why, and that's
why it's easy for me

00:14:15.179 --> 00:14:18.546
to feel good about myself, right?

00:14:18.546 --> 00:14:20.162
And so, I think a lot of people

00:14:20.162 --> 00:14:21.377
