00:15:26.286 --> 00:15:30.965
- How do you know when
you are on the right path,

00:15:30.965 --> 00:15:33.250
and what dream belongs to you,

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.236
or what husband belongs to you,

00:15:35.236 --> 00:15:37.120
