00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.502
- You know you're on the
right path, here's your clue,

00:15:40.502 --> 00:15:44.502
you're not put in a
position to betray yourself.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.396
You don't betray yourself anymore.

00:15:49.396 --> 00:15:51.331
You don't, you're not put in the position

00:15:51.331 --> 00:15:54.748
where you feel like you have to negotiate

00:15:56.669 --> 00:16:01.440
your sense of integrity,
