00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:04.422
your heart, an act of betrayal.

00:16:04.422 --> 00:16:07.525
You don't feel like you have
to compromise who you are.

00:16:07.525 --> 00:16:08.775
It feels right.

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:12.077
- You can fully, I got that,

00:16:12.077 --> 00:16:14.021
it's like if you had a job,

00:16:14.021 --> 00:16:16.241
you know you're really
gifted and talented,

