people are not paying you for
what you value yourself to be,

00:16:20.272 --> 00:16:21.881
you're coming to work
everyday feeling like

00:16:21.881 --> 00:16:24.018
"I'm really not valued.

00:16:24.018 --> 00:16:25.973
"I'm not being respected for what I do",

00:16:25.973 --> 00:16:30.448
or "My boss is unkind", or
whatever the situation might be.

00:16:30.448 --> 00:16:33.344
There is an unease with you.

00:16:33.344 --> 00:16:34.388
- That's right.
- Yeah.

00:16:34.388 --> 00:16:37.949
And so, when you have
more respect for yourself,

00:16:37.949 --> 00:16:40.875
put yourself in a position where you can

00:16:40.875 --> 00:16:43.097
feel your sense of value or worth.

00:16:43.097 --> 00:16:44.779
- Right.
- That turned around.

00:16:44.779 --> 00:16:46.722
- That's right.
- And that's how you know?

00:16:46.722 --> 00:16:48.672
- You know. You know
because you don't feel like,

00:16:48.672 --> 00:16:51.638
"This isn't costing me my power.

00:16:51.638 --> 00:16:54.774
"This isn't costing me my psyche.

00:16:54.774 --> 00:16:57.252
"This isn't costing me my soul".

00:16:57.252 --> 00:16:58.398
- Okay, this is really good.

00:16:58.398 --> 00:17:00.914
- "This isn't costing me my sense of ...

00:17:00.914 --> 00:17:03.554
"I don't feel confused in some deep level.

00:17:03.554 --> 00:17:05.041
"I'm not drained.

00:17:05.041 --> 00:17:08.349
"I can be tired after a day's work,

00:17:08.349 --> 00:17:10.694
"but I'm not psychically drained

00:17:10.694 --> 00:17:13.986
"where I feel like I'm losing life".

00:17:13.986 --> 00:17:15.786
- "And losing myself".
- "And losing myself".

00:17:15.786 --> 00:17:17.107
- That's what a lot of people say,

00:17:17.107 --> 00:17:18.480
"I'm losing myself".
- "I'm losing myself".

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.229
Why? Because I'm betraying
myself in some way.

00:17:22.229 --> 00:17:24.281
- What is the difference?

00:17:24.281 --> 00:17:27.781
Because I have a lot of married friends,

00:17:27.781 --> 00:17:28.614
I have interviewed a lot of people

00:17:28.614 --> 00:17:30.548
