00:17:56.915 --> 00:17:58.220
"Little this, little that".

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.716
But in a compromise you don't go away

00:18:01.716 --> 00:18:04.633
feeling like "I've betrayed myself.

00:18:06.766 --> 00:18:08.703
"I've betrayed myself.

00:18:08.703 --> 00:18:12.870
"I've allowed myself, I've
put poison in my mouth here".

00:18:14.393 --> 00:18:18.076
- Okay, it goes back to
exactly what you said earlier

00:18:18.076 --> 00:18:21.646
that every choice is either
going to enhance your spirit

00:18:21.646 --> 00:18:24.228
or it's going to drain your spirit.

00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:26.865
So, if you have been
compromised to the point

00:18:26.865 --> 00:18:30.032
where you feel drained or depleted ...

00:18:31.415 --> 00:18:32.655
- Right.

00:18:32.655 --> 00:18:33.668
- Then you've betrayed yourself.

00:18:33.668 --> 00:18:36.563
- You have, I mean,
and the number of times

00:18:36.563 --> 00:18:38.614
someone will say to themselves,

00:18:38.614 --> 00:18:40.539
"I want to get out of this circumstance

00:18:40.539 --> 00:18:43.807
"but I'm too afraid to
take care of myself,

00:18:43.807 --> 00:18:46.314
