00:19:37.583 --> 00:19:39.233
- You know, I just had an
"A-ha!" listening to you.

00:19:39.233 --> 00:19:41.642
I love it when that happens to me.

00:19:41.642 --> 00:19:44.116
I've often thought that,

00:19:44.116 --> 00:19:46.302
