worse than being betrayed.

00:19:59.912 --> 00:20:02.379
And just hearing you talk about it today,

00:20:02.379 --> 00:20:05.351
I think there's nothing worst
than betraying yourself,

00:20:05.351 --> 00:20:08.013
that the worst, most ultimate betrayal

00:20:08.013 --> 00:20:09.502
is the betrayal to yourself.

00:20:09.502 --> 00:20:11.335
- You're right.
- Yeah.

