00:20:56.039 --> 00:20:57.420
- I wake up every single morning

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:58.896
with a very clear sense of purpose:

00:20:58.896 --> 00:21:01.424
it's to inspire people
to do what inspires them

00:21:01.424 --> 00:21:03.593
so together we can change our world.

00:21:03.593 --> 00:21:06.112
And I have a very clear vision
of the world I want to live in:

00:21:06.112 --> 00:21:07.517
I would like to live in a world

00:21:07.517 --> 00:21:09.421
in which the vast majority of people

00:21:09.421 --> 00:21:12.107
wake up every single morning
inspired to go to work,

00:21:12.107 --> 00:21:13.527
they feel safe when they're there,

00:21:13.527 --> 00:21:14.980
and they come home at the end of the day

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.653
fulfilled by the work that they do.

00:21:16.653 --> 00:21:18.886
And I've committed all of my work,

00:21:18.886 --> 00:21:20.396
and it doesn't matter what form it takes,

00:21:20.396 --> 00:21:23.031
whether speaking or writing
or teaching or advising,

00:21:23.031 --> 00:21:25.106
it doesn't even matter what form it takes,

00:21:25.106 --> 00:21:28.015
in some way, shape or form
to help advance that vision

00:21:28.015 --> 00:21:29.558
and move close and closer to it.

00:21:29.558 --> 00:21:30.849
- The whole "What do I do
with my life?" question

00:21:30.849 --> 00:21:33.384
implies that adulthood is
this monolithic creature

00:21:33.384 --> 00:21:35.993
that like you acquire
your job and your spouse

00:21:35.993 --> 00:21:37.612
and then you just write it out

00:21:37.612 --> 00:21:40.286
until times winged chariot shows up.

00:21:40.286 --> 00:21:41.281
I thought this when I was younger too,

00:21:41.281 --> 00:21:42.114
and it's not our fault because,

00:21:42.114 --> 00:21:44.746
how does every single
happily-ever-after movie end?

00:21:44.746 --> 00:21:47.409
With finding your one true
love and kissing them,

00:21:47.409 --> 00:21:48.847
