morass of adulthood,

00:21:59.803 --> 00:22:01.519
this monotonous grind,

00:22:01.519 --> 00:22:03.648
in which the only real
excitement in your life

00:22:03.648 --> 00:22:06.445
is occasionally finding
a truly right avocado

00:22:06.445 --> 00:22:07.626
