Now, listen, I'm not going to lie to you,

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:10.078
I get very excited when I find

00:22:10.078 --> 00:22:11.811
the truly right avocado
at the grocery store,

00:22:11.811 --> 00:22:13.821
but it's not the only
excitement in my life.

00:22:13.821 --> 00:22:15.114
And that to me is that one of the reasons

00:22:15.114 --> 00:22:16.586
you're so terrified about figuring out

00:22:16.586 --> 00:22:18.021
what you're going to do with your life

00:22:18.021 --> 00:22:19.596
is that your think that
you're only going to be able

00:22:19.596 --> 00:22:21.115
to do one thing.

00:22:21.115 --> 00:22:22.306
Like, if someone told
you that in four years

00:22:22.306 --> 00:22:23.395
you were going to have to pick

