you will always be figuring
out what to do with your life,

00:22:36.767 --> 00:22:38.876
and you'll get to do
lots of different things,

00:22:38.876 --> 00:22:41.681
and your decisions will
be unmade by circumstance,

00:22:41.681 --> 00:22:44.113
like your wife gets a job in Kuala Lumpur

00:22:44.113 --> 00:22:46.115
or you're staring at
